<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 5.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 5.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Erki Nool was not in the top 10 places after three events in the World Championship games in Athens.</p>
<p>- Discussion are on-going to restore the six kilometre narrow gauge railway track from Viljandi in the south to Blue Spring as a tourist attraction. The line was closed in the 1970s.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
